{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"agent_message","text":"The controller accepted the scoped automatic-exit finding. A separate safety question emerged: after removal, a leader can remain in leader state when `StepDownOnRemoval` is false. The singleton ReadIndex branch checks that the configuration has one voter, but not that this node is that voter. I’ll retain the question and investigate whether a legal removal history can produce a stale read certificate, including any caller duty to stop serving reads after removal.\n"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_5","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat > candidate7.py <<'PY'\nimport json\nm=json.load(open('../audit-spec/v3.json'));m['version']=3\nfor a in m['activities']:a.pop('behavior_ids',None)\nfor f in m['facts']:\n for k in ['established_by','consumed_by']:f.pop(k,None)\nss=[dict(id='s_removal_option',file='raft.go',start_line=272,end_line=283,kind='interface_statement'),dict(id='s_read_safety',file='raft.go',start_line=230,end_line=248,kind='interface_statement'),dict(id='s_raw_read',file='rawnode.go',start_line=556,end_line=564,kind='interface_statement'),dict(id='s_node_read_route',file='node.go',start_line=508,end_line=521,kind='code_observation'),dict(id='s_node_read_entry',file='node.go',start_line=613,end_line=615,kind='code_observation')]\nchanges={}\nB={x['id']:x for x in m['behaviors']}\nfor i in ['b_config','b_snapshot','b_reconstruct']:\n B[i].setdefault('produces_fact_ids',[]).append('f_single_voter_config')\n changes[i]=dict(impact='dependency',source_ids=B[i]['source_ids'],rationale='Record that installing or reconstructing configuration establishes the configured voter cardinality consumed by the singleton read authority shortcut.',preserves='The automatic-exit finding relies on transfer suppression and application wakeup, not singleton membership or read certificates; its history and oracle remain unchanged.')\nm['behaviors'].append(dict(id='b_singleton_read_authority',primary_activity='A2',execution_owner='stepLeader MsgReadIndex branch',protocol_context='StateLeader with current tracker configuration; default StepDownOnRemoval=false may retain leader role after local removal.',trigger='Local or forwarded MsgReadIndex',reads=['trk.IsSingleton(): len(Voters[0])==1 and len(Voters[1])==0','raftLog.committed'],important_branches=['Singleton branch returns read index immediately before the current-term-entry guard and before any quorum heartbeat.','switchToConfig on removed leader returns; only